  "description": "Confluence Flat Bar Altus opens up more ride opportunities with a MAHLE hub-drive electric assist good for 40Nm of torque. This egravel bike features comfortable, confident upright geometry and a flat handlebar for leverage and control. The aluminum frame and carbon fork strike a balance of durability and performance you’ll appreciate, with frame and fork cargo mounts to keep you fueled on those longer rides, or to load up with bikepacking gear. Shimano’s Altus 1x9 drivetrain is a proven workhorse that will get you through any ride without a fuss. Charge Your Adventure with Confluence Flat Bar Altus.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
